WEBVTT

00:01.330 --> 00:02.960
<b>Whoa! That was amazing!</b>

00:02.960 --> 00:07.500
<b>Thanks to Haruka, our class is a team once again.</b>

00:08.540 --> 00:11.710
<b>I promise we'll make our way to you.</b>

00:15.790 --> 00:16.380
<b>FLOOR 85</b>

00:16.130 --> 00:18.460
<b>Just hang in there a bit longer!</b>

00:20.250 --> 00:21.080
<b>Huh?</b>

00:21.380 --> 00:22.380
<b>The place is quaking...</b>

00:30.790 --> 00:32.580
<b>Those kids, sheesh!</b>

00:32.580 --> 00:36.080
<b>Storming in there despite the stampede alert.</b>

00:36.250 --> 00:38.330
<b>What if something happened to 'em?</b>

00:39.250 --> 00:40.000
<b>Huh?</b>

00:40.750 --> 00:41.580
<b>Rats?</b>

00:44.290 --> 00:45.540
<b>Wh-what the heck?</b>

01:22.710 --> 01:23.960
<b>So this is it...</b>

01:25.670 --> 01:27.580
<b>The day's finally here.</b>

01:40.880 --> 01:43.250
<b>From the outermost dungeon...</b>

01:49.000 --> 01:50.540
<b>...a stampede now approaches!</b>

01:57.710 --> 02:00.040
<b>[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]</b>

02:00.210 --> 02:01.130
<b>[Good Luck]</b>

02:12.580 --> 02:15.040
<b>Holed up in my room invincible on Monday</b>

02:15.040 --> 02:17.500
<b>Take one step out and everything's a drag</b>

02:17.630 --> 02:20.040
<b>They're drawn to a flame shouting mayday</b>

02:20.040 --> 02:22.130
<b>I wanna pretend I didn't hear them</b>

02:22.630 --> 02:23.960
<b>Give up on the fair fights</b>

02:24.750 --> 02:26.790
<b>First come first served is an illusion</b>

02:27.330 --> 02:29.130
<b>Leave it all to the dice</b>

02:29.630 --> 02:32.250
<b>But make sure to roll them well</b>

02:32.710 --> 02:34.960
<b>Look, the stuff left behind after splitting things up</b>

02:34.960 --> 02:37.540
<b>Sometimes it's not all that bad y'know</b>

02:37.540 --> 02:40.170
<b>The stuff they have and I don't</b>

02:40.170 --> 02:43.380
<b>Nonsense, I won't be asking for it</b>

02:44.130 --> 02:47.210
<b>Alone & bad I'm doing great</b>

02:47.210 --> 02:49.880
<b>Wait now boy, you free?</b>

02:49.960 --> 02:52.000
<b>Hate grouping up?</b>

02:52.210 --> 02:55.130
<b>If you're bored, wanna try your luck?</b>

02:55.250 --> 02:57.670
<b>Botch & luck handle it and dance</b>

02:57.670 --> 03:00.290
<b>Down & fall is not my style</b>

03:00.420 --> 03:02.880
<b>Good Luck lies in odd numbers</b>

03:02.880 --> 03:05.420
<b>Isn't cheating a skill of its own?</b>

03:16.130 --> 03:18.630
<b>[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]</b>

03:18.710 --> 03:21.040
<b>[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]</b>

03:21.170 --> 03:23.630
<b>[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]</b>

03:23.710 --> 03:24.460
<b>[Good Luck]</b>

03:29.670 --> 03:33.290
<b>Stampede</b>

03:32.250 --> 03:35.830
<b>My worst fears have proven true.</b>

03:35.830 --> 03:38.000
<b>Think our new pals are all right?</b>

03:38.630 --> 03:40.210
<b>They're in that dungeon, yeah?</b>

03:41.460 --> 03:46.580
<b>If I remember right, there should be an old text
about the dungeon here...</b>

03:52.170 --> 03:53.630
<b>Yeah, this is it.</b>

03:55.460 --> 03:57.250
<b>Dungeons are living things.</b>

03:57.710 --> 04:00.460
<b>They spread lower, floor by floor.</b>

04:01.880 --> 04:04.580
<b>and when they grow full-size to the bottom floor...</b>

04:05.210 --> 04:10.960
<b>All the monsters who can no longer fit inside
begin endlessly pouring out.</b>

04:12.630 --> 04:14.830
<b>That's what these stampedes are.</b>

04:15.330 --> 04:17.500
<b>What can we do to stop it?</b>

04:18.040 --> 04:24.210
<b>According to this text, when the boss
at the lowest level is defeated, the dungeon dies, too.</b>

04:24.710 --> 04:29.630
<b>And with it all the monsters within disappear.
Or so this says.</b>

04:30.580 --> 04:36.380
<b>Seems the only way to stop the stampede
is to defeat the boss.</b>

04:37.420 --> 04:40.920
<b>And just who exactly is capable of doing that?</b>

04:47.170 --> 04:48.420
<b>No, no, no, no!</b>

04:51.830 --> 04:52.580
<b>Is it here?!</b>

04:53.540 --> 04:58.210
<b>Ofter, get the people to shelter!
Keep them from breaking into a panic!</b>

04:58.710 --> 04:59.630
<b>Got it!</b>

05:00.080 --> 05:05.040
<b>Gatek, get our people to the front gate!
We'll hold this place with our very lives!</b>

05:05.290 --> 05:06.080
<b>On it!</b>

05:06.420 --> 05:08.920
<b>Come and get it, you monsters!</b>

05:09.420 --> 05:12.040
<b>We'll take real good care of you all!</b>

05:19.460 --> 05:21.000
<b>Griffins...</b>

05:21.130 --> 05:25.580
<b>Was never sure if they were birds or lions...</b>

05:26.540 --> 05:29.500
<b>But they're sure taking to my paralyshroom-doused fish!</b>

05:38.380 --> 05:41.210
<b>Guess they were fish-loving birds after all.</b>

05:41.960 --> 05:42.630
<b>Hyaa!</b>

05:44.170 --> 05:46.380
<b>Alrighty! Another floor down!</b>

05:47.460 --> 05:50.460
<b>FLOOR 54</b>

05:50.630 --> 05:52.880
<b>I know this is rough, but keep at it!</b>

05:53.040 --> 05:55.290
<b>You bet! This is for Haruka!</b>

05:55.580 --> 05:58.290
<b>We want to find him soon, too!</b>

06:02.500 --> 06:04.210
<b>Hmm? There's something up ahead!</b>

06:07.250 --> 06:10.960
<b>Those beasts are... werewolves!</b>

06:23.580 --> 06:25.130
<b>So this is a stampede...</b>

06:26.330 --> 06:29.380
<b>I've never seen so many monsters before.</b>

06:30.130 --> 06:33.210
<b>Boss, we managed the first wave...</b>

06:33.330 --> 06:35.130
<b>But I dunno if we'll last the next.</b>

06:37.580 --> 06:41.670
<b>Hey, those new kids are in the dungeon now, right?</b>

06:41.670 --> 06:42.330
<b>Yeah...</b>

06:43.170 --> 06:47.000
<b>Wait, you're not gonna ask them
to defeat the dungeon boss, right?</b>

06:47.420 --> 06:51.290
<b>Think, though! That boy might be able to pull it off!</b>

06:52.080 --> 06:55.130
<b>Sir Haruka may truly be our only hope...</b>

06:55.630 --> 06:59.790
<b>If we could only tell him
how to put a stop to this stampede...</b>

07:00.670 --> 07:04.460
<b>Who's gonna go run messages in the middle of all this?</b>

07:06.040 --> 07:06.830
<b>Oh!</b>

07:06.920 --> 07:08.960
<b>Stareeeeee...</b>

07:09.170 --> 07:12.830
<b>Huh? What? Me?!</b>

07:13.330 --> 07:15.790
<b>I can't! Won't! Shan't!</b>

07:15.960 --> 07:18.460
<b>Don't make me go to the dungeon alone!</b>

07:18.880 --> 07:21.130
<b>This is a crucial mission.</b>

07:21.380 --> 07:23.920
<b>One too difficult for a lone little girl.</b>

07:24.500 --> 07:29.040
<b>Ofter, you'll go with her. You know the dungeon well.</b>

07:29.750 --> 07:34.000
<b>Yeah, but we need to get ready for the next attack.</b>

07:34.330 --> 07:36.880
<b>Don't worry. Leave this place to us!</b>

07:37.290 --> 07:41.920
<b>The rest of us will keep this town safe
no matter what comes our way!</b>

07:42.290 --> 07:43.000
<b>Yep!</b>

07:44.670 --> 07:46.710
<b>Fine. You got it!</b>

07:47.710 --> 07:49.210
<b>Let's get going.</b>

07:49.580 --> 07:51.420
<b>What? B-But...</b>

08:02.040 --> 08:04.040
<b>S-so be it...</b>

08:05.000 --> 08:06.790
<b>I'll make the journey!</b>

08:07.580 --> 08:11.580
<b>FLOOR 81</b>

08:09.500 --> 08:11.580
<b>This some kind of aquarium?</b>

08:12.130 --> 08:14.580
<b>No, it's Water World!</b>

08:15.500 --> 08:18.000
<b>The lower levels were just full of powerful enemies.</b>

08:18.710 --> 08:21.130
<b>But up here the floors themselves are trouble.</b>

08:22.580 --> 08:24.040
<b>Monsters in the water?!</b>

08:28.830 --> 08:30.210
<b>I let myself get distracted.</b>

08:30.830 --> 08:32.500
<b>Sorry. Thanks for that.</b>

08:36.670 --> 08:38.830
<b>Now we're up against underwater baddies.</b>

08:39.290 --> 08:42.330
<b>SWORDFISH</b>

08:42.460 --> 08:44.380
<b>A school of swordfish?</b>

08:44.830 --> 08:47.830
<b>If these things all swim at me at once...</b>

08:48.460 --> 08:49.670
<b>Bwa-wa-wah!</b>

08:49.670 --> 08:52.290
<b>...will I get sliced into strips?!</b>

08:52.630 --> 08:53.710
<b>Sashimi!</b>

08:54.670 --> 08:57.130
<b>I need to do something about that speed.</b>

08:58.170 --> 09:01.790
<b>Fishmongers usually freeze their supply, yeah?</b>

09:02.830 --> 09:06.920
<b>Let's try using that ice magic I derived from my
temperature magic to cool them down a bit.</b>

09:16.000 --> 09:19.040
<b>All right! They look slower already!</b>

09:21.540 --> 09:23.750
<b>Guess they're weak to cold after all.</b>

09:24.290 --> 09:26.670
<b>Now to finish it off with some Packing.</b>

09:33.880 --> 09:35.630
<b>Get your fresh, frozen fish!</b>

09:37.710 --> 09:39.750
<b>Operation: Fishmonger worked great!</b>

09:41.710 --> 09:46.330
<b>All right! Now to freeze every last one!</b>

09:46.920 --> 09:48.920
<b>Let's run right through this place!</b>

10:01.170 --> 10:02.250
<b>What the heck?!</b>

10:02.790 --> 10:04.170
<b>Is THAT the boss?!</b>

10:06.500 --> 10:09.710
<b>Think it's mad I took care of its friends?</b>

10:11.080 --> 10:13.040
<b>YUP, IT'S PISSED!</b>

10:13.960 --> 10:16.000
<b>Run for it! That wave's gonna swallow us!</b>

10:16.000 --> 10:16.710
<b>Shoot!</b>

10:32.000 --> 10:34.960
<b>With my special surfboard made from earth magic...</b>

10:35.670 --> 10:38.080
<b>...I'm gonna ride these waves!</b>

10:39.000 --> 10:41.710
<b>Caught a big one! Talk about a thrill!</b>

10:45.710 --> 10:46.540
<b>Hup!</b>

10:50.040 --> 10:52.000
<b>Jumbo-jump!</b>

10:52.750 --> 10:54.670
<b>Now to use Dummy to control things from outside...</b>

10:55.500 --> 10:57.630
<b>...and lock on to that big head!</b>

11:01.130 --> 11:04.170
<b>Phew, there's the biggun taken care of, too.</b>

11:04.580 --> 11:05.580
<b>Hup!</b>

11:07.000 --> 11:09.040
<b>Oh, were you okay?</b>

11:12.460 --> 11:15.540
<b>Glad to hear it! Let's keep this up!</b>

11:17.460 --> 11:20.330
<b>Man, this is going great!</b>

11:21.790 --> 11:24.040
<b>I'm starting to enjoy this dungeon crawl thing!</b>

11:25.330 --> 11:27.790
<b>FLOOR 79</b>

11:27.790 --> 11:31.790
<b>Ring of Boundless Fortune</b>

11:27.790 --> 11:31.790
<b>Grants happiness and repels misfortune</b>

11:27.790 --> 11:31.790
<b>Greatly boosts LuK</b>

11:28.000 --> 11:31.040
<b>I found the Ring of Boundless Fortune on Floor 79!</b>

11:32.000 --> 11:35.920
<b>FLOOR 77</b>

11:36.630 --> 11:38.830
<b>And in the secret room on Floor 77...</b>

11:38.920 --> 11:41.920
<b>Blessed Bangle</b>

11:38.920 --> 11:41.920
<b>(Blessing) Sublimates disaster</b>

11:38.920 --> 11:41.920
<b>[Only once while equipped]</b>

11:39.040 --> 11:41.500
<b>...I got the Blessed Bangle!</b>

11:42.250 --> 11:43.790
<b>FLOOR 75</b>

11:42.330 --> 11:43.460
<b>Firewall!</b>

11:43.790 --> 11:47.040
<b>NECROMANCER</b>

11:47.040 --> 11:51.540
<b>And the boss of Floor 75
dropped the Necromancy Jewel!</b>

11:50.880 --> 11:52.710
<b>Necromancy Jewel</b>

11:50.880 --> 11:52.710
<b>Grants control over the dead</b>

11:53.380 --> 11:55.540
<b>Now this is the dungeon life.</b>

11:55.670 --> 11:57.330
<b>Chock full o' treasure.</b>

11:59.330 --> 12:02.710
<b>If I sell all this off I might be rich!</b>

12:03.130 --> 12:04.790
<b>Or should I use them myself?</b>

12:05.460 --> 12:10.250
<b>But my luck is off the charts
and I'm not cursed or anything...</b>

12:14.500 --> 12:15.130
<b>Here.</b>

12:16.670 --> 12:20.670
<b>I want you to be happy again after being cursed
by that darkness, Armored Rep.</b>

12:21.380 --> 12:24.130
<b>I did make you put on that cursed armor and all.</b>

12:24.750 --> 12:25.790
<b>So you can have these!</b>

12:27.500 --> 12:30.130
<b>Go on! The jewel's a little something extra.</b>

12:30.420 --> 12:32.710
<b>Girls love their fashion accessories, right?</b>

12:34.710 --> 12:35.880
<b>Go on, now!</b>

12:53.250 --> 12:56.830
<b>You're a weird skeleton, getting all happy like that.</b>

12:58.540 --> 13:01.290
<b>Now to see if there are any more secret rooms!</b>

13:32.000 --> 13:35.290
<b>FLOOR 54</b>

13:33.040 --> 13:35.830
<b>Here goes the last one!</b>

13:39.380 --> 13:43.380
<b>We did it. That's all the werewolves, right?</b>

13:43.790 --> 13:45.080
<b>Is everyone okay?</b>

13:45.290 --> 13:48.750
<b>Y-yeah... We're okay.</b>

13:49.630 --> 13:51.830
<b>I'm ready for a bath...</b>

13:52.330 --> 13:54.750
<b>But Haruka's counting on us!</b>

13:55.250 --> 13:58.960
<b>Yup. We're almost there, everyone!</b>

14:01.540 --> 14:04.540
<b>What now?! Are there still werewolves left?!</b>

14:04.540 --> 14:05.630
<b>What?!</b>

14:09.920 --> 14:12.960
<b>Merielle? Ofter, too?!</b>

14:15.330 --> 14:17.210
<b>Wasn't expecting this...</b>

14:17.460 --> 14:23.460
<b>FLOOR 74</b>

14:17.830 --> 14:21.670
<b>First it's Water World, now a fire stage?</b>

14:23.580 --> 14:25.460
<b>What?!</b>

14:25.790 --> 14:31.250
<b>I came all this way because I thought Sir Haruka
capable of halting this stampede!</b>

14:35.540 --> 14:36.460
<b>Don't worry.</b>

14:36.790 --> 14:37.420
<b>Huh?</b>

14:37.750 --> 14:39.540
<b>I'm sure he can.</b>

14:40.460 --> 14:42.130
<b>Lady Rep...</b>

14:42.790 --> 14:46.460
<b>But we don't know where he is. What do we do?</b>

14:46.790 --> 14:49.460
<b>Hey, do we not have like, a magic way to talk to him?</b>

14:49.580 --> 14:52.330
<b>We'd have used it already if we did.</b>

14:59.830 --> 15:02.580
<b>It's HOT. Scorching hot...</b>

15:04.130 --> 15:08.920
<b>Thanks to my Spatial Awareness and Trap Detection
Skills I know this is a trap floor.</b>

15:09.880 --> 15:14.750
<b>But I dunno if I can disable it
before this heat eats me up...</b>

15:19.630 --> 15:20.830
<b>Sorry 'bout that.</b>

15:23.210 --> 15:27.250
<b>What's that? You want me to rest up there?</b>

15:29.830 --> 15:30.960
<b>Thanks...</b>

15:32.210 --> 15:34.170
<b>We don't have time to stand around!</b>

15:34.420 --> 15:35.250
<b>Still!</b>

15:35.250 --> 15:36.830
<b>We need to settle down!</b>

15:37.670 --> 15:39.750
<b>We have to find him fast!</b>

15:46.830 --> 15:48.460
<b>It's so hot...</b>

15:49.380 --> 15:52.080
<b>This is wearing me out more than I thought.</b>

15:52.790 --> 15:56.750
<b>I need to think up something to boost my stamina.</b>

16:01.920 --> 16:02.580
<b>Wind...?</b>

16:04.380 --> 16:07.580
<b>Haruka, where in the world are you?</b>

16:11.380 --> 16:13.210
<b>Hmm? Wind?</b>

16:19.750 --> 16:22.210
<b>Cool at last!</b>

16:23.250 --> 16:25.920
<b>I used wind magic to stir up a light breeze.</b>

16:28.540 --> 16:30.880
<b>Gotta say, this was a genius idea.</b>

16:33.080 --> 16:35.750
<b>Man, this is amazing!</b>

16:36.000 --> 16:37.420
<b>That's Haruka's voice!</b>

16:40.920 --> 16:44.580
<b>Hey! I can hear his voice through this wall!</b>

16:46.420 --> 16:48.420
<b>Talk about the perfect hole.</b>

16:49.210 --> 16:50.330
<b>Haruka!</b>

16:50.330 --> 16:51.670
<b>Haruka, is that you?!</b>

16:52.830 --> 16:54.920
<b>Huh? That you, Rep?</b>

16:55.040 --> 16:56.080
<b>It is!</b>

16:58.420 --> 17:02.210
<b>Oh, this must be the hole I fell through.</b>

17:02.670 --> 17:04.080
<b>Hey!</b>

17:04.540 --> 17:05.580
<b>Hey!</b>

17:05.920 --> 17:08.130
<b>My voice reaches them! Lucky me!</b>

17:08.830 --> 17:11.420
<b>Hey! Can you climb up this hole?</b>

17:12.290 --> 17:14.170
<b>I tried, but no luck!</b>

17:16.420 --> 17:18.750
<b>Do you have any rope up there?</b>

17:20.000 --> 17:21.290
<b>Anyone have rope?</b>

17:23.080 --> 17:25.380
<b>Hey! What floor are you on?</b>

17:25.830 --> 17:27.580
<b>Floor 54!</b>

17:28.380 --> 17:30.130
<b>I'm better off just running for it.</b>

17:31.380 --> 17:34.080
<b>Okay! I'll be right there!</b>

17:36.040 --> 17:38.250
<b>Wait! I need to tell you something!</b>

17:38.670 --> 17:40.790
<b>The town is in trouble!</b>

17:41.210 --> 17:41.960
<b>Huh?</b>

17:42.250 --> 17:43.380
<b>You see...</b>

17:51.880 --> 17:53.750
<b>A dungeon stampede?!</b>

17:54.040 --> 17:59.830
<b>The people of the guild are holding it off,
but they won't last much longer!</b>

18:00.330 --> 18:01.670
<b>That voice...</b>

18:01.670 --> 18:03.210
<b>Merry-Merry?</b>

18:04.630 --> 18:09.290
<b>On our way here we saw
the second wave of the stampede!</b>

18:12.920 --> 18:16.540
<b>If a third wave makes it, the town is done for!</b>

18:18.380 --> 18:20.210
<b>Oh! The old guy's with you!</b>

18:20.210 --> 18:22.500
<b>Who you callin' old, huh?!</b>

18:22.500 --> 18:23.960
<b>Enough of that!</b>

18:24.420 --> 18:28.290
<b>There is only one way to stop a third wave!</b>

18:28.830 --> 18:30.920
<b>You must defeat the dungeon boss!</b>

18:33.880 --> 18:35.750
<b>The dungeon boss...?</b>

18:44.170 --> 18:46.000
<b>Oh, well actually...</b>

18:47.290 --> 18:49.000
<b>...I already beat the boss.</b>

18:49.380 --> 18:50.630
<b>You what?!</b>

18:50.920 --> 18:52.290
<b>That's incredible!</b>

18:52.290 --> 18:53.420
<b>I don't believe it.</b>

18:53.710 --> 18:55.670
<b>What were you doing after that fall?</b>

18:56.380 --> 18:57.130
<b>Hmm?</b>

18:57.330 --> 18:58.460
<b>Hang on!</b>

18:58.790 --> 19:02.130
<b>If you beat the boss, why was there a second wave?</b>

19:02.790 --> 19:04.000
<b>Good point.</b>

19:04.000 --> 19:06.000
<b>Maybe it started before he won?</b>

19:06.000 --> 19:08.040
<b>What about the monsters here, though?</b>

19:08.670 --> 19:11.540
<b>Hey! Did you make sure to finish it off?!</b>

19:11.540 --> 19:12.290
<b>Huh?</b>

19:12.290 --> 19:15.710
<b>If it's not REALLY dead, this stampede won't end!</b>

19:17.460 --> 19:22.460
<b>The only way to stop the stampede
is to finish off the boss.</b>

19:25.330 --> 19:27.380
<b>You made sure to kill it, right?!</b>

19:29.790 --> 19:34.830
<b>So if I don't kill the Armored Rep,
then everyone in town is doomed...</b>

19:36.710 --> 19:41.420
<b>I started that fight with every intention of killing the boss.</b>

19:41.830 --> 19:43.670
<b>But I couldn't!</b>

19:44.830 --> 19:46.250
<b>The Armored Rep...</b>

19:47.210 --> 19:49.330
<b>No, Angelica...</b>

19:50.130 --> 19:52.250
<b>She was held prisoner by this dungeon.</b>

19:53.040 --> 19:57.080
<b>All alone for who knows how many years...</b>

19:58.710 --> 20:02.420
<b>I can't bring myself to kill her!</b>

20:02.960 --> 20:04.920
<b>Hey! Answer me!</b>

20:06.130 --> 20:07.630
<b>I didn't kill the boss!</b>

20:07.630 --> 20:08.540
<b>What?!</b>

20:09.130 --> 20:10.830
<b>Huh?! You didn't?!</b>

20:10.830 --> 20:12.040
<b>Why not?!</b>

20:15.330 --> 20:17.250
<b>What in the world?</b>

20:20.210 --> 20:24.500
<b>How can I save her and the town?</b>

20:27.670 --> 20:28.500
<b>That's it.</b>

20:28.790 --> 20:29.830
<b>Maybe...</b>

20:31.130 --> 20:32.580
<b>Don't worry.</b>

20:33.000 --> 20:37.380
<b>I might need your help, though.</b>

20:42.170 --> 20:43.580
<b>I'm sure we can do it.</b>

20:44.790 --> 20:46.420
<b>I'll stop the stampede!</b>

20:47.290 --> 20:48.040
<b>Huh?!</b>

20:48.460 --> 20:52.540
<b>There's no way to do that without finishing off the boss!</b>

20:53.080 --> 20:55.710
<b>Haruka! You're sure you stand a chance?</b>

20:56.750 --> 20:58.460
<b>Yup! Leave it to me!</b>

21:00.170 --> 21:01.170
<b>Fine.</b>

21:01.460 --> 21:03.170
<b>I choose to believe him!</b>

21:03.170 --> 21:04.380
<b>Come, now.</b>

21:04.920 --> 21:07.630
<b>Even you?</b>

21:08.790 --> 21:12.460
<b>It'll be okay if he says it will!</b>

21:15.880 --> 21:19.750
<b>I know he might worry us from time to time.</b>

21:22.040 --> 21:26.630
<b>But despite it all, he comes through to save us.</b>

21:27.880 --> 21:29.250
<b>He protects us.</b>

21:30.630 --> 21:33.500
<b>He would never betray us.</b>

21:35.250 --> 21:36.830
<b>That's just who he is!</b>

21:37.580 --> 21:38.460
<b>Yeah!</b>

21:40.500 --> 21:43.460
<b>So I choose to believe in him!</b>

21:47.540 --> 21:49.750
<b>Thanks, Class Rep.</b>

21:51.630 --> 21:56.170
<b>I'm going to save everyone in that town.</b>

21:58.540 --> 22:01.330
<b>And Angelica, too!</b>

22:03.790 --> 22:07.130
<b>I'll free her from this prison, I swear!</b>

22:18.790 --> 22:23.130
<b>The sunset I saw alone was beautiful</b>

22:23.250 --> 22:28.580
<b>Without telling anyone about it at all it's time for bed again</b>

22:28.580 --> 22:32.830
<b>Going on not worried about loneliness</b>

22:32.830 --> 22:38.420
<b>Encountering one new something after the next</b>

22:38.420 --> 22:45.170
<b>Been through a lot but it's unimaginable, isn't that funny?</b>

22:45.710 --> 22:50.170
<b>Might look indifferent but that's not always the case</b>

22:50.290 --> 22:54.790
<b>Never learning, carefree and doing as I please</b>

22:55.170 --> 22:59.790
<b>That's always the way it is, we're all our lone selves</b>

22:59.920 --> 23:04.580
<b>As we pass by we trade hellos and goodbyes</b>

23:04.960 --> 23:09.630
<b>Doesn't matter, just wanna enjoy today</b>

23:09.630 --> 23:14.460
<b>Have a bit of fun and then it's goodnight</b>

23:14.960 --> 23:19.670
<b>Sha-na-na-na-na, sha-na-na-na-na humming a tune</b>

23:19.830 --> 23:23.880
<b>Thinking about the day I see you again</b>

23:24.790 --> 23:29.540
<b>Sha-na-na-na-na, sha-na-na-na-na humming a tune</b>

23:29.670 --> 23:33.460
<b>In the middle of my journey alone</b>
